³1ip³268.2.118.55³2ts³21080535236³2version³21³2name³2text_default³2data³2summary³3*³3text³3'''http://BetterThanYours.com -- Better Webhosting.  Cheaper too.'''

http://BetterThanYours.com already offers some of the lowest prices for webhosting, starting as low as $14.95/per year.

All hosting plans include: Web-based administration (Control Panel), POP e-mail accounts with web access, unlimited e-mail aliases, unlimited e-mail forwards, catchall e-mail address, your own mailing list(s) with mailing list manager, FTP account(s), Frontpage extensions, PHP, password-protected directories, server-side includes (SSI), cgi-bin with PERL, log files & site stats, daily backup, 24x7 monitoring & tech support by e-mail, anti-Spam technology, annual billing & pricing, NO SETUP FEES, and much more!

Money-back guarantee, if you don't like our services.

Give us a try:  Go get your domain name, enter "ns1.betterthanyours.com" and "ns2.betterthanyours.com" as the name servers, then send us an e-mail to mailto:sales@betterthanyours.com with the details.  We'll get you up an running in about 8-16 hours, then we'll invoice you for the hosting.  Take 30 days to use it, if you don't like our service, tell us, and forget the bill.

Final benefit:  All principals at BetterThanYours.com are far-out anarcho-capitalist, libertarian Libertarians, who already love to give excellent customer service to many of our fellow-travelers.  :-)

If you've ever been interested in having your own website, here's your chance to give it a try, risk free. Check it out.

http://BetterThanYours.com. Better webhosting, cheaper too. 

--------------------
 -- Michael Kielsky
 4 Peaks Technology Group, Inc.
 http://4peakstech.com
 http://betterthanyours.com
